# pip-audit, which the Security workflow's dependency audit runs on Windows,
# compiled to pip-audit.txt with exact versions and hashes. Resolved for
# Python 3.12, the version that job runs: some of pip-audit's dependencies
# are conditional on it (typing_extensions). Dependabot proposes each new
# release.
#
# Regenerate from .github/requirements/:
#   uv pip compile pip-audit.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -o pip-audit.txt
pip-audit==2.10.1
